32.0d-6     !DT (timestep to be taken)
1          !LSOLVE(1) = U
1          !LSOLVE(2) = V
1          !LSOLVE(3) = PC
1          !LSOLVE(4) = Species
1          !LSOLVE(5) = Soot
1          !LSOLVE(6) = Temperature
1000000      !total number of timesteps to be taken
250        !how often results files are printed
0          !write a detailed soot results file
1          !mechanism selection (1=DLR)
1          !SootModel (1=Section,2=2-eq,3=2-eq with Benzene Inception)
1.0        !Alpha_surf. If =5, use functional form
35         !Number of sections in the sectional model
2.35       !Spacing factor for the sections
1.0d0        !Operating pressure (in atmospheres)
1          !L3, number of CVs in the axial (x) direction per CPU
238        !M3, number of CVs in the radial (y) direction
32.d-6    !DTmax, maximum timestep that is allowable
1000      !minimum number of iterations prior to increasing the timestep
1d-3       !minimum slope of conservation variables for automatic timestepping
100        !factor that adjusts the slope target for autotimestepping
0          !sets whether the outer radial boundary is a wall, or free slip condition (1=wall, else = free slip)         
